&oh=00_Af4FvfTOpTfuV9spGLByUmLt09ja1TVn6Ts_-2IM3AFm2A&oe=6A11BEA8"}, {"file_name": "screen3.png", "id": "258935755667723", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75297580_258935759001056_2813863870203173318_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BoNbREhvrHkQ7kNvwFG3Ru8&_nc_oc=AdqpnyxGnTYYwffgyhtdGEPRy7hr5gmkDMnv3OFZ0t6tXJ8oZ5StPWil549OJkMx5wM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4fcmqFeQGtDBqn-v84E-wyMSGMGwP7DBnq_KRa3gSQ0w&oe=6A11AF12"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38982658_535757437737335_5271675859752528110_n.png", "id": "816059002445368", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210893_816059005778701_1392764768497568274_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1SlGJPFVVwwQ7kNvwG9VUCK&_nc_oc=Ados_2pbHEYXnj8HuiQv-5zOfp3PAKAogUyZLyl2SmqFey31hDigPnfXRr5HWVkUp30&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4IfN24Yk_H--GCn5luGZjhu6veUgRJVfNY1RYTt4wsMQ&oe=6A11A4D3"}, "display_name": "The Secret of Retropolis Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The Secret of Retropolis is a VR narrative game of a new kind, a blend of classic point-and-click adventure with immersive cinematography. Embody the witty protagonist of a film noir plot. Meet unforgettable characters. Solve puzzles. Lose yourself in the retro-futuristic atmosphere.\n\nEXPERIENCE IN COMFORT.\nAs a seated experience with intuitive controls, first time VR users will find this game engaging and easy to play. Experienced VR users will find this game casual and relaxing.\n\nSTORY. ART. MUSIC.\nEnter a sprawling retro-futuristic cityscape with an original score, ensemble of voice actors and detailed hand drawn (in VR!) environments.\n\nGOOD \u2018OL ADVENTURE GAME\nBoot up that nostalgia for your favorite 90's point-and-click adventure games. Look around. Find items. Solve puzzles. Keep the past alive.\n\n\n* No robots were harmed in the making of this game.", "s